uage","selectedNotice":"Selected:","changeLaterTip":"You can change the language anytime later in settings."},"terms":{"title":"Term and Condition","sectionIntro":"I. Introduction","introTitle":"I. Introduction","agreeCheckboxLabel":"Agree to all Terms and Conditions","agreeButton":"I agree","validationError":"Please agree to the Terms and Conditions to proceed.","loadError":"Failed to load Terms and Conditions.","termsContent":"These General Terms and Conditions (the “Terms”) govern the use of products and services offered by [Microfinance Institution Plc.] (the “Institution”). They are provided to help all clients (the “Client”) understand their rights and obligations before applying for or using any of the Institution’s products or services.\\n\\nBy signing any application form for the Institution’s products or services, or by providing instructions or using the services without an application form, the Client is deemed to have read, understood, and accepted these Terms, as well as any additional specific terms and conditions applicable to each product or service.\\n\\nAll personal data, transaction records, and identity documents are stored in strict compliance with the applicable data protection regulations of Cambodia and the National Bank of Cambodia."}},"auth":{"login":{"title":"Welcome Back","subtitle":"Please sign in with your credentials to access your LOS dashboard.","companyId":"Company ID","companyIdPlaceholder":"Enter Company ID","userId":"User ID","userIdPlaceholder":"Enter User ID or Email","password":"Password","passwordPlaceholder":"Enter your password","forgotPassword":"Forgot password?","signInButton":"Sign In","validationCompanyRequired":"Company ID is required","validationUserRequired":"User ID is required","validationPasswordRequired":"Password must be at least 6 characters"},"otp":{"title":"OTP Verification","subtitle":"Enter the 6-digit code sent to your registered phone or email.","resendCode":"Resend Code","resendIn":"Resend in","verifyBu